# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# Signing material — never commit an identity. The distribution
# certificate lives in the IOS_DIST_CERT_P12 GitHub secret and the App
# Store Connect key in ASC_KEY_CONTENT; the CI writes them to disk while
# it signs (see ios/fastlane/Fastfile).
*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
ios_dist.key
*.p12.b64
